# WorldForge Terrain System Migration Plan  
## 3D SDF Backend + Hybrid Runtime Modification Architecture

---

## 🎯 Objective

Transition WorldForge to a modern voxel architecture that supports:

- Deterministic world generation
- True 3D terrain (caves, overhangs, lava tubes)
- Smooth voxel rendering
- Real-time digging and building
- Persistent world modifications
- Scalable simulation systems

Without breaking the current working game loop.

---

## 🧠 Core Architectural Principle

Separate the world into **three responsibilities**:

```text
Natural World      → 3D SDF Generator (deterministic)
Modified World     → Runtime Edit Layer (dig/build)
Persistent State   → Terrain Snapshot (save/load truth)
````

---

## ⚠️ Critical Rule

**Do NOT modify the current terrain system in-place.**

Instead:

```text
Build new SDF system alongside existing system
→ Add backend switch
→ Test in isolation
→ Gradually migrate systems
→ Retire old system last
```

