## 🧩 Step 2 — VoxelWorldManager as Router

Do NOT let this class become the terrain generator.

It should only:

```text
- Receive world data
- Cache snapshot
- Select terrain backend
- Apply generator to voxel world
- Handle runtime edits
```

---

### Backend Routing

```cpp
switch (TerrainBackend)
{
    case LegacyHeightmap:
        ApplyLegacyTerrain();
        break;

    case SDFLayered:
        ApplySDFTerrain();
        break;
}
```

